msgid "Have you not already acquired an arm suitable for <if ($gn68 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if>? I fail to see the value in seeking another."
msgstr "Разве у тебя уже нет оружия для <if ($gn68 == 10)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if>? Не вижу смысла искать ещё одно."

